---
title: Our Story
summary: The mission and vision that guide Great Commission University of America.
---

# Our Mission

Great Commission University of America prepares and empowers Spirit-filled Christian leaders to proclaim the Gospel, fulfill the Great Commission, and serve Christ effectively throughout the world.

# Our Vision

We seek to develop Christ-centered, biblically grounded, and Holy Spirit-empowered leaders who make disciples and advance God's Kingdom.

Our graduates are prepared to demonstrate spiritual maturity, strong biblical knowledge, and effective ministry skills as transformational leaders in churches, families, communities, and nations.
